### =========================================
### 🚀 1. UPLOAD SEMANAL (GERA DADOS)
### =========================================
POST http://localhost:3000/ranking/semanal
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="turma_id"

2
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data_inicio"

2026-03-14
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data_fim"

2026-03-18
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="dias_aula"

4
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="arquivo_base"; filename="BASE.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< BASE.xlsx
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="arquivo_faltas"; filename="FALTAS.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< FALTAS.xlsx
--MyBoundary--


### =========================================
### 📊 2. TABELA GESTOR (SEM FILTRO)
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking/tabela
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 📊 3. TABELA FILTRADA POR TURMA
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking/tabela?turmaId=2
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 📅 4. TABELA FILTRADA POR DATA
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking/tabela?dataInicio=2026-03-01&dataFim=2026-03-31
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 📊 5. TABELA COMPLETA (TUDO JUNTO)
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking/tabela?turmaId=2&dataInicio=2026-03-01&dataFim=2026-03-31
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 🏆 6. RANKING SEMANAL (TELA GAMER)

### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking?tipo=semanal
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 🟣 7. RANKING MENSAL (ACUMULADO)
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking?tipo=mensal
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 📅 8. RANKING SEMANAL COM DATA
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking?tipo=semanal
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### 📅 9. RANKING MENSAL COM DATA
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking?tipo=mensal
Content-Type: application/json


### =========================================
### ⚡ 10. DEFAULT (SEM TIPO = SEMANAL)
### =========================================
GET http://localhost:3000/ranking
Content-Type: application/json

